      "number": 552,
      "title": "lf land: fail fast when release tag already exists on origin",
      "body": "## Summary\n\nPrevents `lf land` from creating a worktree, PR, and other release machinery when the target tag already exists on origin. Previously this would fail late in the process after unnecessary work.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Check for existing remote tag immediately after resolving the version, before creating worktrees or PRs\n- Fetch tags from origin in `latest_tag_optional` so locally missing tags (created in other worktrees or clones) are visible\n- Clear error message pointing the user to use a higher version if the tag is taken",
