    {
      "number": 555,
      "title": "steps: remove .lf/steps/ overrides, refine builtins",
      "body": "## Summary\n\nDeletes all 60 `.lf/steps/` files (2700+ lines) that were local overrides of builtin steps. The builtins in `rust/loopflow/src/engine/builtins/steps/` are now the single source of truth.\n\nAlongside the deletion, several builtins get targeted improvements:\n\n## Changes\n\n- **Remove `.lf/steps/`** — all 60 local step overrides deleted. These were duplicates (or stale forks) of the engine builtins.\n- **gate**: add validation/metrics capture phase and structured PR body template (Try it, Intent, Assumptions, Key decisions, Not included)\n- **pr**: expand PR body guidance to match gate's structured template\n- **review**: add results/metrics as step 2 in the opening orientation\n- **design + kickoff**: add `Measure` section to design doc template for quantitative before/after tracking\n- **update-wave**: rename \"items\" → \"sprints\" throughout, add structured README.md spec (Vision, Strategy, Goals, Risks, Metrics), add sprint finish-line format, replace scratch deletion with trim-to-validation-only policy\n- **land, release, review, gate**: standardize Adaptation sections — guide users toward repo docs first, `.lf/steps/` copies only when the workflow itself needs to differ",
      "files": [],
      "additions": 93,
      "deletions": 2731,
