      "number": 611,
      "title": "wave: restructure wave items, add garden wave-report step",
      "body": "## Summary\n- Restructures macos, model, and pm wave items\n- Archives completed/obsolete waves to `wave/old/`\n- Adds `wave-report` garden step\n- Adds redesign wave roadmap\n\nThese files were left uncommitted by `lf gate` due to the standalone step commit bug (fixed in #610).\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Wave files parse correctly\n- [ ] `wave-report` step resolves",
